#: 9fe00f51a8bc4c3aba2013753c646bf9
msgid ""
"UART1 is tied internally to a 2.4GHz ELRS receiver module and defaulted to "
"that protocol."
msgstr "UART1内部连接至2.4GHz ELRS接收机模块，默认使用该协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoof405hd.rst:96
#: 60993584ba5a4a1f9ccef02b4ed5d770
msgid ""
"There are two pins provided for SBUS input also, one being inverted and "
"applied to UART3 RX, and another to UART5 RX on the DJI connector. To use "
"either, the :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` would have to be "
"changed to something other than \"23\", and the "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` set to \"23\", for use of its SBUS"
" pin, or :ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` set to \"23\", in order "
"tho use the SBUS input on the DJI Connector."
msgstr ""
"另外还提供了两个SBUS输入引脚，一个经过反相后接入UART3 RX，另一个接入DJI连接器上的UART5 RX。要使用其中任一个，需要将 "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 改为「23」以外的值，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` 设置为「23」以使用其SBUS引脚，或将 "
":ref:`SERIAL5_PROTOCOL<SERIAL5_PROTOCOL>` 设置为「23」以使用DJI连接器上的SBUS输入。"

